lain THE POISONER debuts this week. Here's everything we know, plus the awesome twist that makes this story unmissable. Posts 1 By Robert Wood See the First Image of Captain America's New Costume, Just Released by Marvel Captain America Marvel reveals a new costume for Steve Rogers' Captain America, updating the Super Soldier for a new era. (Don't worry, the shield stays the same.) Posts By Robert Wood Founding X-Men Hero Officially Debuts Nightmare-Fuel Redesign X-Men As Marvel's new Midnight imprint turns X-Men into a horror series, a founding member of the mutant team transforms into pure nightmare fuel. Posts 1 By Robert Wood 7 Funniest Archie Jughead Strips That Are Aging Like Fine Wine Archie Comics Jughead Jones has arguably aged the best out of any Archie Comics character, and he's had some truly iconic comic strip gags to make the case for him. Posts By J.R. Waugh Marvel Corrupts The Avengers' Logo In Shocking New Image Avengers Marvel's iconic Avengers emblem is flipped upside down in a shocking new image that teases the team's next multiversal crisis installment. Posts By Nicolas Ayala See More See More", "lists": [["Movies Submenu Movie Features Movie News Movie Reviews Movie Lists Movie Trailers TV Submenu TV Features TV News TV Reviews TV Lists Network TV Submenu Network TV Schedule Reality TV Submenu Reality TV Features Reality TV News Reality TV Lists Comics Submenu Comic Features Comic News Comic Reviews Comic Lists Videos", "Movies Submenu Movie Features Movie News Movie Reviews Movie Lists Movie Trailers", "Movie Features", "Movie News", "Movie Reviews", "Movie Lists", "Movie Trailers", "TV Submenu TV Features TV News TV Reviews TV Lists", "TV Features", "TV News", "TV Reviews", "TV Lists", "Network TV Submenu Network TV Schedule", "Network TV Schedule", "Reality TV Submenu Reality TV Features Reality TV News Reality TV Lists", "Reality TV Features", "Reality TV News", "Reality TV Lists", "Comics Submenu Comic Features Comic News Comic Reviews Com